# Backend builds use the repository root as their context. Only ship runtime inputs.
**
!backend/
backend/**
!backend/Dockerfile
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/app/
!backend/app/**
!data/
data/**
!data/safety_sources/
!data/safety_sources/**

# These remain excluded even if accidentally created inside an allowed directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.zip
**/*.parquet
**/*.duckdb*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.dump
**/*.partial
**/*.tmp
**/.DS_Store
